          "description": "This is the last part of the Little Explorers - London travel guide series. In this card, your child will follow along with step-by-step instructions to draw the London city scene along with all the amazing memories they had captured using the other cards of this series. This will be a great souvenir for them to remember for years to come. Please remind your child to press the button on the yoto player when they are ready to go after each step.",
